    generate a row that prepends a FIXED_LONG hash of your first row
    component to your row (replacing it as the "first" component)
    - Schema.addStreamStoreDefinition() now has an overload that allows
    you to add this first row component hash to its tables
    - Ended up updating a bunch of schemas with other changes to the
    renderer

