commit 648864118d17e15f7278ab2c17ca2479fe88f17f
Author: Robert Liu <rliu@palantir.com>
Date:   Thu Sep 24 11:24:53 2015 -0700

    Add hashFirstRowComponent to TableDefinition

    - You can now add hashFirstRowComponent() to your TableDefinition to
    generate a row that prepends a FIXED_LONG hash of your first row
    component to your row (replacing it as the "first" component)
    - Schema.addStreamStoreDefinition() now has an overload that allows
    you to add this first row component hash to its tables
    - Ended up updating a bunch of schemas with other changes to the
    renderer

    ==REGENERATED_SCHEMA==
    ==TESTED_DB_UPGRADE==

    Change-Id: I439128d90d1388001612ae2bb060176c91d3e779

